<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Users Database - Dashboard</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f8f9fa; color: #333; padding: 24px; line-height: 1.5; }
    .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 4px; padding: 24px; }
    .nav { margin-bottom: 20px; padding-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
    .nav a { color: #0d6efd; text-decoration: none; margin-right: 15px; font-size: 14px; }
    .nav a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    h1 { font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #111; }
    p { font-size: 14px; color: #555; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .status-box { background: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px; margin: 16px 0; }
    .status-box h2 { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 6px; color: #222; }
    .count { font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; color: #0d6efd; margin: 8px 0; }
    .actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 20px; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 14px; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid #ccc; cursor: pointer; }
    .btn-primary { background-color: #0d6efd; color: #fff; border-color: #0d6efd; }
    .btn-primary:hover { background-color: #0b5ed7; }
    .btn-outline { background-color: #fff; color: #333; border-color: #d1d5db; }
    .btn-outline:hover { background-color: #f3f4f6; }
    .btn-danger { background-color: #dc3545; color: #fff; border-color: #dc3545; }
    .btn-danger:hover { background-color: #bb2d3b; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="nav">
      <strong>UserDB (Backend)</strong> &nbsp;|&nbsp;
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <a href="/user">All Users</a>
      <a href="/user/new">Add User</a>
      <a href="/user/delete">Delete User</a>
    </div>

    <h1>User Management System</h1>
    <p>Database dashboard and REST API interface connected to MySQL.</p>

    <div class="status-box">
      <h2>Database Summary</h2>
      <div class="count"><%= count %></div>
      <p style="margin: 0;">Total registered users in the database.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="actions">
      <a href="/user" class="btn btn-primary">View All Users</a>
      <a href="/user/new" class="btn btn-outline">+ Add New User</a>
      <a href="/user/delete" class="btn btn-danger">Delete a User</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
